# Kept deliberately empty.
#
# `envDir` in vitest.config.mts points here so Vite loads no `.env` file for the test run.
# Git cannot track an empty directory, so this file exists only to create it. Do not put a
# `.env` here: anything in this directory becomes a test-visible environment variable, which
# is the exact thing the `envDir` setting is there to prevent.
